Version 0.95.10 BETA (2026-11-22)
* NEW FEATURE: "Reset all" individually for both Fonts and Colors in Options.
* NEW FEATURE: Live font previews and color swatches with color hex values the Fonts & Colors dialog.
* NEW FEATURE: Enable the import of cookies using Unix seconds with a decimal fraction.
* BUG FIX: Fix the crash that occurs when you click on the notifications preview button (this was caused by trying to make the Options dialog open faster).
* BUG FIX: Address multiple minor issues.

Version 0.95.9 BETA (2026-11-21)
* NEW FEATURE: Feed Properties now shows the last update attempt, the last successful update, and a countdown to the next scheduled check.
* NEW FEATURE: Add a Supporters tab under Help -> About to thank donators. The Version tab also offers the Donate button if it was included in your build, even when hidden in the main window.
* CHANGE: Make it easier to see where a feed will land when you drag it to a new position for dark themes.
* BUG FIX: Fix the "Parameter count mismatch" error when adding feeds in the Linux AppImage and on some other installations.
* BUG FIX: Stop the Add Feed progress indicator when feed discovery takes over, and show "Select all" once there are results to select.
* BUG FIX: Give the network time to reconnect after waking from sleep before starting scheduled feed updates.
* BUG FIX: Prevent failed database upgrades from leaving the article library partly upgraded.
* BUG FIX: Fix notification sounds that can cut off early and a possible crash when a sound fails to load.
* BUG FIX: Address multiple minor issues.

