* CHANGE: Require TLS 1.2 or newer for HTTPS connections.
* CHANGE: Make troubleshooting logs less noisy and show what triggered automatic backups.
* BUG FIX: Report failures when saving the in-memory database and offer retry or recovery options if saving on exit fails.
